OL,3,AElla Langley's Choosin' Texas becomes
OL,4,Alongest-running number one in US chart
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FElla Langley's country smash Choosin'
OL,8,FTexas has overtaken Mariah Carey's All
OL,9,FI Want for Christmas Is You to become
OL,10,Fthe longest-running number one single
OL,11,Fin US chart history.
OL,13,FReleased last October, the bittersweet
OL,14,Fsong details Langley's suspicions that
OL,15,Fher boyfriend is about to run off with
OL,16,Fanother woman.
OL,18,FIt topped the US Billboard chart for
OL,19,Fthe first time in February, and has now
OL,20,Fspent 23 weeks at number one.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
