OL,3,AElla Langley's Choosin' Texas becomes
OL,4,Alongest-running number one in US chart
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FChoosin' Texas also rose to pole
OL,8,Fposition on the UK singles chart at the
OL,9,Fstart of September, where it replaced
OL,10,FSam Fender and Olivia Dean's Rein Me
OL,11,FIn.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
