OL,3,AAutopsy shows Hayden Panettiere died
OL,4,Afrom a drug overdose
OL,5,
OL,6,FChild star Hayden Panettiere died from
OL,7,Fthe toxic effects of fentanyl, Xanax
OL,8,Fand several other drugs in her system,
OL,9,Faccording to an autopsy completed by
OL,10,Fthe Greenville County Coroner's Office
OL,11,Fin South Carolina.
OL,13,FThe coroner's office said Panettiere's
OL,14,Fdeath was an accident and that no signs
OL,15,Fof trauma were discovered that would
OL,16,Fhave contributed to her death.
OL,18,FPanettiere died last month at the age
OL,19,Fof 36 after she was found unresponsive
OL,20,Fat a South Carolina residence.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
