OL,4,Afrom a drug overdose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe star of US TV shows Heroes and
OL,7,FNashville had spoken openly about her
OL,8,Fstruggles with substance abuse.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
