OL,3,ATim Westwood charged with two more
OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer BBC Radio 1 and Capital Xtra DJ
OL,7,FTim Westwood has been charged with two
OL,8,Fmore offences, the Metropolitan Police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe charges are an alleged indecent
OL,12,Fassault against a teenage girl aged 16
OL,13,Fto 17 in Hammersmith and Fulham in 1991
OL,14,Fand the alleged sexual assault of an
OL,15,F18-year-old woman in Wandsworth in
OL,16,F2004.
OL,18,FThese charges are in addition to those
OL,19,Fbrought against Westwood, 68, in
OL,20,FOctober 2025 relating to seven women,
OL,21,Fwhich include four counts of rape.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
